Subject: [PATCH] incusd/storage: Strip non-regular files from instance
 metadata
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

This addresses GHSA-5pgx-q9xx-j3qv (CVE pending)

Signed-off-by: Stéphane Graber <stgraber@stgraber.org>
